{"title":"Icebound Deckhand","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 52 Icebound that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=52\">Lv 52</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>11</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>11</td><td>in the wilds around -130, -1018</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2453.4px,1570.6px)\"><i style=\"left:2453.4px;top:-1570.6px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -126, -1018 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"icebound-deckhand\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Icebound: <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner\">Icebound Harpooner</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate\">Icebound Mate</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-captain\">Drowned Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/a0e9472e143399ca2d45.svg\" alt=\"Icebound Deckhand\"></div><h3>Icebound Deckhand</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>52 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 56–56)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Icebound</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>330</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>33.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2600</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}